### **Vấn đề với Result trong Consumer:**

#### **1. Consumer không return Result:**
```csharp
// ❌ Consumer không có return type
public class CreatePropertyConsumer : IConsumer<CreateProperty>
{
 public async Task Consume(ConsumeContext<CreateProperty> context)
 {
 // Không thể return Result ở đây
 var result = await someService.DoSomething();
 // Làm gì với result?
 }
}
```

#### **2. Error Handling khác biệt:**
<augment_code_snippet path="services/PropertyService/Property.Application/Consumers/CreatePropertyConsumer.cs" mode="EDIT">
```csharp
public async Task Consume(ConsumeContext<CreateProperty> context)
{
 try
 {
 var property = new Domain.Aggregates.AggregateRoot.Property(/*...*/);
 await repo.Create(property);

 // ✅ Success response
 await context.RespondAsync<PropertyCreated>(new
 {
 PropertyId = property.Id,
 CorrelationId = context.Message.CorrelationId,
 });
 }
 catch (Exception ex)
 {
 // ✅ Error response - không dùng Result
 await context.RespondAsync<PropertyCreationFailed>(new
 {
 CorrelationId = context.Message.CorrelationId,
 Error = ex.Message
 });

 // Hoặc throw để MassTransit retry
 throw;
 }
}
```
</augment_code_snippet>

### **Nếu muốn dùng Result pattern:**

<augment_code_snippet path="services/PropertyService/Property.Application/Consumers/CreatePropertyConsumer.cs" mode="EDIT">
```csharp
public async Task Consume(ConsumeContext<CreateProperty> context)
{
 // ✅ Dùng Result trong business logic
 var result = await propertyService.CreatePropertyAsync(context.Message);

 if (result.IsSuccess)
 {
 await context.RespondAsync<PropertyCreated>(new
 {
 PropertyId = result.Value.Id,
 CorrelationId = context.Message.CorrelationId,
 });
 }
 else
 {
 await context.RespondAsync<PropertyCreationFailed>(new
 {
 CorrelationId = context.Message.CorrelationId,
 ErrorCode = result.Error.Code,
 ErrorMessage = result.Error.Description
 });
 }
}
```
</augment_code_snippet>

### **Tạo Service Layer:**

<augment_code_snippet path="services/PropertyService/Property.Application/Services/PropertyService.cs" mode="EDIT">
```csharp
public class PropertyService(IPropertyRepository repo)
{
 public async Task<Result<Property>> CreatePropertyAsync(CreateProperty message)
 {
 try
 {
 var property = new Domain.Aggregates.AggregateRoot.Property(/*...*/);
 await repo.Create(property);
 return Result<Property>.Success(property);
 }
 catch (Exception ex)
 {
 return Result<Property>.Failure(new Error("Property.CreateFailed", ex.Message));
 }
 }
}
```
</augment_code_snippet>

**Kết luận**: Dùng Result trong business logic, nhưng Consumer handle response/error theo MassTransit pattern!
